</b>'s door. So surplus flows upward, and standing becomes wealth.","village":s:"Runestead","agent":n:4014000000000000,"x":n:404508bffc27c567,"y":n:403fd3e334bd317b,"causes":[s:"agent:5",s:"ev:273",],},{"id":n:407aa00000000000,"tick":n:40bdd10000000000,"day":n:4073f00000000000,"year":n:404b000000000000,"type":s:"death","txt":s:"<b>Torv the Ironhand</b> died of old age at 70. Much knowledge died with them — unless someone learned in time.","agent":n:4010000000000000,"x":n:404ab1d4b0682eb1,"y":n:4031df298dbb461d,"cause":s:"age","causes":[s:"cause:age",],},{"id":n:407ab00000000000,"tick":n:40bdd10000000000,"day":n:4073f00000000000,"year":n:404b000000000000,"type":s:"customLost","txt":s:"🍂 Torv humming by the fire as the light fades until the end. No one else ever took it up. It died quietly, as most things do.","custom":s:"c8",},{"id":n:407ac00000000000,"tick":n:40bdd10000000000,"day":n:4073f00000000000,"year":n:404b000000000000,"type":s:"customLost","txt":s:"🍂 Idun placing a stone on the grave until the end. No one else ever took it up. It died quietly, as most things do.","custom":s:"c9",},{"id":n:407ad00000000000,"tick":n:40bde80000000000,"day":n:4074000000000000,"year":n:404b000000000000,"type":s:"failed","txt":s:"<b>Idun</b> tried something with gold — and failed. But failure teaches.","agent":n:402a000000000000,},{"id":n:407ae00000000000,"tick":n:40bdfa0000000000,"day":n:4074100000000000,"year":n:404b000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Rune</b> taught <b>Sixten</b> the secret of Eira's herb-lore. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"medicine",},{"id":n:407af00000000000,"tick":n:40bdfb0000000000,"day":n:4074100000000000,"year":n:404b000000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"✨ <b>Vidar</b> lay awake in the dark and watched the lights that do not fall.","agent":n:4030000000000000,"x":n:40501c387079fb8e,"y":n:402bd7d16e9e0da6,},{"id":n:407b000000000000,"tick":n:40be0a0000000000,"day":n:4074100000000000,"year":n:404b000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Saga</b> 